{"version":3,"term":{"cols":105,"rows":65},"timestamp":1788480520,"command":"/tmp/bogon_and_private_ip","title":"Bogon, Private & Loopback IP Subnets","env":{"SHELL":"/usr/bin/zsh"}}
[0.001, "o", "=== http_logviewer: Bogon, Private & Loopback IP Subnet Handling (Phase 03 / Category C) ===\r\n\r\n[1] RFC 1918 Private IPv4 Range Detection (Item 01):\r\n  IP: 10.0.0.1               -> RFC 1918: true | Kind: RFC 1918 Private LAN (10.0.0.0/8 Private Network)\r\n  IP: 10.255.255.254         -> RFC 1918: true | Kind: RFC 1918 Private LAN (10.0.0.0/8 Upper Boundary)\r\n  IP: 172.16.0.1             -> RFC 1918: true | Kind: RFC 1918 Private LAN (172.16.0.0/12 Lower Boundary)\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  IP: 172.24.10.50           -> RFC 1918: true | Kind: RFC 1918 Private LAN (172.16.0.0/12 Mid Range)\r\n  IP: 172.31.255.254         -> RFC 1918: true | Kind: RFC 1918 Private LAN (172.16.0.0/12 Upper Boundary)\r\n  IP: 192.168.1.1            -> RFC 1918: true | Kind: RFC 1918 Private LAN (192.168.0.0/16 Common Gateway)\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  IP: 192.168.100.200        -> RFC 1918: true | Kind: RFC 1918 Private LAN (192.168.0.0/16 Host)\r\n  IP: ::ffff:192.168.1.1     -> RFC 1918: true | Kind: RFC 1918 Private LAN (IPv4-Mapped IPv6 RFC 1918)\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n[2] Loopback and Link-Local Range Detection (Item 02):\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  IP: 127.0.0.1              -> Loopback: true | LinkLocal: false | Classification: Loopback / Host\r\n  IP: 127.1.2.3              -> Loopback: true | LinkLocal: false | Classification: Loopback / Host\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  IP: ::1                    -> Loopback: true | LinkLocal: false | Classification: Loopback / Host\r\n  IP: localhost              -> Loopback: true | LinkLocal: false | Classification: Loopback / Host\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  IP: ::ffff:127.0.0.1       -> Loopback: true | LinkLocal: false | Classification: Loopback / Host\r\n  IP: 169.254.1.1            -> Loopback: false | LinkLocal: true | Classification: Link-Local / Autoconf\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  IP: fe80::1                -> Loopback: false | LinkLocal: true | Classification: Link-Local / Autoconf\r\n  IP: fe80::1%eth0           -> Loopback: false | LinkLocal: true | Classification: Link-Local / Autoconf\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n[3] Advanced Subnet & Topology Classification (CGNAT, Multicast, ULA, Bogon):\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "  IP: 100.64.0.1             -> Carrier-Grade NAT (CGNAT)    | Private: true | Bogon: false\r\n  IP: 100.127.255.254        -> Carrier-Grade NAT (CGNAT)    | Private: true | Bogon: false\r\n  IP: 224.0.0.1              -> Multicast Group              | Private: true | Bogon: false\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  IP: ff02::1                -> Multicast Group              | Private: true | Bogon: false\r\n  IP: fc00::1                -> IPv6 Unique Local (ULA)      | Private: true | Bogon: false\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  IP: fd12:3456:789a::1      -> IPv6 Unique Local (ULA)      | Private: true | Bogon: false\r\n  IP: 0.0.0.0                -> Reserved / Bogon Range       | Private: true | Bogon: true\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  IP: 240.0.0.1              -> Reserved / Bogon Range       | Private: true | Bogon: true\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  IP: 255.255.255.255        -> Limited Broadcast            | Private: true | Bogon: true\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  IP: 192.0.2.1              -> Documentation / Test Net     | Private: false | Bogon: true\r\n  IP: 198.51.100.1           -> Documentation / Test Net     | Private: false | Bogon: true\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  IP: 203.0.113.1            -> Documentation / Test Net     | Private: false | Bogon: true\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  IP: 2001:db8::1            -> Documentation / Test Net     | Private: false | Bogon: true\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  IP: 8.8.8.8                -> Public Internet              | Private: false | Bogon: false\r\n\r\n[4] Distinct Local / Internal Traffic Markers & Badges (Item 03):\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  ------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n  INTERNAL IP           | EMOJI MARKER             | DETAILED TOPOLOGY MARKER\r\n  ------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  127.0.0.1             | 🏠 Local / Private LAN | 🏠 Local / Private LAN (Loopback / Host)\r\n  10.0.0.1              | 🏠 Local / Private LAN | 🏠 Local / Private LAN (RFC 1918 Private LAN)\r\n  172.16.5.1            | 🏠 Local / Private LAN | 🏠 Local / Private LAN (RFC 1918 Private LAN)\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  192.168.1.100         | 🏠 Local / Private LAN | 🏠 Local / Private LAN (RFC 1918 Private LAN)\r\n  169.254.1.1           | 🏠 Local / Private LAN | 🏠 Local / Private LAN (Link-Local / Autoconf)\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  fe80::1               | 🏠 Local / Private LAN | 🏠 Local / Private LAN (Link-Local / Autoconf)\r\n  ------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n  Fallback ASCII badges (for NO_EMOJI=1 / dumb terminals):\r\n    127.0.0.1       -> [LAN] Local / Private LAN\r\n    127.0.0.1       -> [LAN] Local / Private LAN\r\n    192.168.1.1     -> [LAN] Local / Private LAN\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "    192.168.1.1     -> [LAN] Local / Private LAN\r\n\r\n[5] GeoIpEngine Seamless Integration (Instant Resolution with Zero DB Lookups):\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  IP: 192.168.1.1      -> Badge: 🏠 LO | Code: LO | Private: true | Name: Local / Private Network\r\n  IP: 10.1.2.3         -> Badge: 🏠 LO | Code: LO | Private: true | Name: Local / Private Network\r\n  IP: 127.0.0.1        -> Badge: 🏠 LO | Code: LO | Private: true | Name: Local / Private Network\r\n  IP: 8.8.8.8          -> Badge: 🇺🇸 US | Code: US | Private: false | Name: United States\r\n  IP: 78.46.100.2      -> Badge: 🇩🇪 DE | Code: DE | Private: false | Name: Germany\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n=== All Phase 03 Category C capabilities operational! ===\r\n"]
